    "resultEn": "Eliminated Manual Overhead: Fully automated bulk communication flows, saving hours of manual labor per campaign.\nEnhanced Customer Support: Enabled instantaneous customer inquiry resolution with a robust automated chatbot powered by a customizable knowledge base.\nPerfect Data Consistency: Maintained 100% automated data alignment between the dashboard database and team Google Sheets.\nFull Campaign Visibility: Provided clear, real-time diagnostic logs indicating delivery success, pending states, and specific API error messages for rapid debugging.",
